`_declaredTeammateSecrets()` previously parsed the in-tree factory workflow, so a secret added/renamed on the factory side flipped this test automatically. Now it returns a literal — if `factory-teammate.yml` (at `dmtools-agentic-workflows@b93dc51`) ever declares a new required secret, this test keeps passing with the stale set while the real workflow call fails at startup ("required secret not mapped"), i.e. the guard no longer guards this axis.

